<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko" data-theme="light">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>{{ date }} · AI Daily Papers</title>
  <meta name="description" content="{{ date }} 허깅페이스 Daily Papers 핵심 논문 {{ papers|length }}편 한글 요약" />
  <script>
    (function () {
      try {
        var t = localStorage.getItem("theme");
        if (!t) t = matchMedia("(prefers-color-scheme: dark)").matches ? "dark" : "light";
        document.documentElement.setAttribute("data-theme", t);
      } catch (e) {}
    })();
  </script>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/static/pretendard.min.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="../../assets/css/style.css" />
</head>
<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="wrap">
      <a class="brand" href="../../">
        <span class="logo">AI</span>
        <span>AI Daily Papers<small>허깅페이스 논문 요약 아카이브</small></span>
      </a>
      <div class="header-actions">
        <a class="icon-btn" href="https://github.com/mini486ok/AI_daily_papers" target="_blank" rel="noopener" title="GitHub" aria-label="GitHub">↗</a>
        <button class="icon-btn" id="themeToggle" title="라이트/다크 모드 전환" aria-label="테마 전환">🌙</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="day-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <a class="back" href="../../">← 전체 아카이브</a>
      <h1>{{ date }} 의 AI 논문</h1>
      <p>허깅페이스 Daily Papers에서 선별한 핵심 논문 {{ papers|length }}편을 한글로 요약했습니다.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <main>
    <div class="wrap">
      {% for p in papers %}
      <article class="paper" id="paper-{{ p.id }}">
        <div class="visual">
          {% if p.infographic.image_path %}
          <img loading="lazy" src="{{ p.infographic.image_path }}" alt="{{ p.title_ko or p.title }} 인포그래픽" />
          {% else %}
          <div class="ph" style="display:grid;place-items:center;height:100%;font-weight:800;color:var(--text-mute)">인포그래픽 준비 중</div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
        <div class="content">
          <div class="prank">#{{ p.rank }}{% if p.is_priority %} · 우선 토픽{% endif %}</div>
          <h3>{{ p.title_ko or p.title }}</h3>
          <div class="en">{{ p.title }}</div>
          <div class="meta">
            <span class="org">🏛 {{ (p.organizations | join(", ")) or p.org_hint or "소속 정보 미상" }}</span>
            {% if p.upvotes %}<span>▲ {{ p.upvotes }}</span>{% endif %}
            <span class="tags">
              {% for t in p.topics %}<span class="tag" data-t="{{ t }}">{{ t }}</span>{% endfor %}
            </span>
          </div>

          {% if p.summary.core_idea %}
          <div class="sec"><h4>핵심 아이디어</h4><p>{{ p.summary.core_idea }}</p></div>
          {% endif %}
          {% if p.summary.key_results %}
          <div class="sec"><h4>주요 결과</h4><ul>{% for r in p.summary.key_results %}<li>{{ r }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul></div>
          {% endif %}
          {% if p.summary.conclusion %}
          <div class="sec"><h4>결론 및 시사점</h4><p>{{ p.summary.conclusion }}</p></div>
          {% endif %}
          {% if p.summary.affiliations %}
          <div class="sec"><h4>저자 소속</h4><p>{{ p.summary.affiliations }}</p></div>
          {% endif %}

          <div class="links">
            {% if p.arxiv_pdf_url %}<a class="btn primary" href="{{ p.arxiv_pdf_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">arXiv 원문 PDF</a>{% endif %}
            {% if p.arxiv_abs_url %}<a class="btn" href="{{ p.arxiv_abs_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">arXiv 초록</a>{% endif %}
            {% if p.hf_url %}<a class="btn" href="{{ p.hf_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Hugging Face</a>{% endif %}
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="wrap">
      데이터 출처: <a href="https://huggingface.co/papers" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Hugging Face Daily Papers</a> · 원문: <a href="https://arxiv.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">arXiv</a>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src="../../assets/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
